(7683573, 1257523, 65234, '<td valign="top">This cries out for a shallower DOF to my eye, and a slightly different composition. The keychain is kind of a focal point but I want the background more blurred and a "face" as a focal point. It''s just what I expect from this kind of subject. I clearly have a different vision for this image; you may prefer it as is.</td>', 'This cries out for a shallower DOF to my eye, and a slightly different composition. The keychain is kind of a focal point but I want the background more blurred and a "face" as a focal point. It''s just what I expect from this kind of subject. I clearly have a different vision for this image; you may prefer it as is.', '2021-01-06 08:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
