(7684389, 1257730, 98565, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Beaubeau:</b></div><hr/><i> Nicely done.  If you want to control the syrup, spray the pancakes with scotch guard.  Its a trick used by food photographers. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh, thanks for the trick, Susan, I''ve never heard it before. Unfortunately you can''t eat the pancakes any more then ... which we actually did in this case &amp;#128521;</td>', 'Originally posted by Beaubeau: Nicely done.  If you want to control the syrup, spray the pancakes with scotch guard.  Its a trick used by food photographers.   Oh, thanks for the trick, Susan, I''ve never heard it before. Unfortunately you can''t eat the pancakes any more then ... which we actually did in this case &#128521;', '2021-01-14 00:37:32.000000', NULL, 0),
